        "text": "Original / rebuilt exact 114688 69f437799ed15090185a8c1b178840ba4d305295fe119052ce6faec6faf8659d\nOriginal streams: 27\nVBA modules, storages: ['ThisWorkbook', 'Sheet1', 'Chart2', 'Chart3', 'Sheet4', 'Sheet5', 'Module1'] ['_VBA_PROJECT_CUR', '_VBA_PROJECT_CUR/VBA']\nOriginal P-code verified, one procedure Interp.\nBIFF records 3498 exact formula/view cover {'0x18': 2, '0x6': 1000, '0x4bc': 36, '0x221': 8, '0x1051': 175}\nBRAI enclosing hierarchy Counter({(True, 4099): 132, (False, 4133): 43}) non-Series links 43\nOwner label disagreements 0 []\nA same-width B12 source literal change produced exactly the predicted eight-byte span, with other workbook data equal.\n"
